This folder is based on qpwoeirut/2048 by Stanley Zhong, a version of
gabrielecirulli/2048 by Gabriele Cirulli that plays itself with the strategies
from qpwoeirut/2048-solver. The AI build (js/players.js, js/players.wasm) and
its weights are his; model.gz holds those weights rounded and compressed from
his original model.bmp. All three are under the MIT licence; their notices
follow.

https://github.com/qpwoeirut/2048
https://github.com/qpwoeirut/2048-solver
https://github.com/gabrielecirulli/2048

